    {
      "id": 4,
      "claim": "External pressure on the bottle in the valley exceeds the internal pressure trapped at the mountain top, creating a net inward force on the bottle walls.",
      "evidence": "Pressure difference ΔP = P_valley – P_mountain top > 0 acts over the bottle surface, pushing inward.",
